<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="07">
<name>Steering</name>
<section id="1000U_S0017" variety="S0017">
<name>Steering Column</name>
<ttl id="1000U_S0017_745FR_T00AZ" variety="T00AZ">
<name>Electric Power Steering System</name>
<para id="RM000000URL00GX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="480XQ-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000000URL00GX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___00005WX00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC and Freeze Frame Data</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC and Freeze Frame Data</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the DTCs and freeze frame data. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000URU00GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTCs and freeze frame data (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM000000URU00GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTCs (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000URO00DX"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded DTCs and freeze frame data, reproduce the problem symptom and check again whether DTCs are output.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If a CAN communication system malfunction code is output, troubleshoot and repair the CAN communication first. (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000001R4W009X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If SST (TaSCAN) cannot communicate with the power steering computer assembly, inspect the CAN communication between DLC3 and the power steering computer assembly, and the IG circuit of the power steering computer assembly.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.47in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.61in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Normal DTC</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Malfunction code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTC normal, symptom cannot be confirmed or reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Refer to the DTC Chart [<xref label="Seep03" href="RM000000URO00DX"/>], perform troubleshooting for each code and go to step 7</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (<xref label="Seep05" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Symptom Chart (see <xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000URR00HX"/>)</testtitle>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.47in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.61in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Perform troubleshooting for the applicable symptom, then go to step 7</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (see <xref label="Seep07" href="RM000000URV00GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM000000URQ00GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>